sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Shop as E-commerce platform
    participant GW as API gateway :8080
    participant M as Merchant service :8086
    participant MDB as Merchant PostgreSQL
    participant O as Order service :8082
    participant ODB as Order PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant D as Dispatch service
    Note over Shop,GW: Integration contract: B2B route and API-key/JWT filter coordination still required in Member 1 gateway
    Shop->>GW: POST /api/v1/b2b/orders + X-API-Key + externalRef
    GW->>M: POST /internal/v1/api-keys/validate (on cache miss)
    M->>MDB: Match SHA-256 hash; check key expiry/revocation and merchant APPROVED
    M-->>GW: Valid merchant identity or invalid result
    Note over GW,M: Gateway may cache validation in Redis; raw key is removed before forwarding
    alt Missing or invalid API key
        GW-->>Shop: 401 Unauthorized
    else Verified merchant context
        GW->>M: Forward with verified X-Merchant-Id, MERCHANT role and correlation ID
        M->>MDB: Lock merchant; require APPROVED
        alt Merchant not approved
            M-->>Shop: 403 Forbidden (via gateway)
        else Approved merchant
            M->>M: Normalize phone/district/weight; validate parcel details
            M->>MDB: Find receipt by merchantId + externalRef
            alt Existing local receipt
                M-->>Shop: 200 existing orderId/trackingNumber, created=false
            else No local receipt
                M->>O: POST /internal/v1/orders + normalized body + correlation ID
                O->>ODB: Idempotent creation on merchantId + externalRef
                O->>MQ: order.created for a newly created order only
                MQ-->>D: Deliver order.created
                O-->>M: 201 new or 200 existing orderId + trackingNumber
                M->>MDB: Persist receipt and commit merchant transaction
                M-->>Shop: 201 new or 200 existing order result (via gateway)
            end
        end
    end
    Note over M,O: Remote order commit survives a local receipt failure; downstream idempotency protects retry
    Note over M,D: Merchant ingestion does not call the legacy direct order.created publisher
    Note over Shop,M: Bulk endpoint: 1-500 items with per-item results; correlation ID preserved
